{
  "summary": "The experiment tested weighted fusion using the same RNA (PCA) and image (ResNet50) encoders as the concatenation baseline (experiment 001). Validation accuracy (0.5232) and F1 (0.5084) were slightly lower than concatenation's 0.5266 and 0.5104, suggesting weighted fusion may be less effective. However, the relative impact of fusion strategies remains uncertain without further comparative analysis."
}

